Checks of crates/outfile (swmm-out) and crates/gpkg (swmm5-gpkg), run 19 November 2026.
Engine: swmm5-rust at commit c2af2d3 plus these two crates. rustc 1.97.0, terrio 0.9.0,
swmm-toolkit 0.17.0, GDAL 3.12.4 through pyogrio, RustGIS 0.7.0 (PyPI). Models from SWMMBobSWMM6/1729-SWMM5-Models-2030 and tests/models.
Greenville_US_nofiles.inp is Greenville/Greenville_all_SWMM5_Features.inp with its three SAVE lines in [FILES] commented out
(they name files on a Windows desktop).

