=== tools/open_in_rustgis.py Greenville_US.gpkg greenville_rustgis.png
notice: Greenville_US.gpkg: 2 attribute-only tables not added: GeoPackage attribute tables are not supported
notice: EPSG:3435: the most accurate datum transformation needs a grid RustGIS doesn't have yet, so the next one was used; places may be metres off (NAD27, for one, is about 10 m off without its grid)
RustGIS 0.7.0 sees:
  subcatchments  Polygon     30 features, 21 fields
  nodes          Point      172 features, 25 fields
  links          Polyline   235 features, 23 fields
styled links by rpt_max_flow, nodes by rpt_max_depth; wrote greenville_rustgis.png

